{"instance_id": "pallets__flask-6093", "repo": "pallets/flask", "base_commit": "514fc6b3e8402e4c646d5284e97a4f0ab50a7c4b", "issue_url": "https://github.com/pallets/flask/issues/6093", "query": "IPv6 addresses parsed incorrectly because of `.partition(\":\")`?\nHi, I checked the code and saw that two places use `.partition(\":\")` on addresses, and IPv6 addresses contain \":\".\n\nThis breaks 1. `session_transaction` value setting, and 2. `Flask.run()` if `SERVER_NAME` is set. I've already prepared two tests that fail, you can use them to reproduce:\n\n1. In `test_testing.py`\n```\ndef test_session_transaction_ipv6(app):\n    base_url = \"http://[::1]:8000/\"\n    client = app.test_client()\n\n    @app.get(\"/\")\n    def index():\n        return str(flask.session.get(\"value\"))\n\n    with client.session_transaction(base_url=base_url) as sess:\n        sess[\"value\"] = 42\n\n    assert client.get(\"/\", base_url=base_url).text == \"42\"\n```\n\n2. Add one case to `test_run_from_config`\n```\n(None, None, \"[::1]:8080\", \"::1\", 8080),\n```\n\nIs this known and intended? I could send the patches for these two places.", "pr_urls": ["https://github.com/pallets/flask/pull/6096"], "weak_targets": ["src/flask/app.py/Flask/run", "src/flask/testing.py/FlaskClient/session_transaction"], "weak_source_targets": ["src/flask/app.py/Flask/run", "src/flask/testing.py/FlaskClient/session_transaction"], "modified_test_functions": [], "review_flags": ["multi_function_pr"], "candidate_evaluations": [{"positive_id": "src/flask/app.py/Flask/run", "semantic_similarity": 0.332614, "semantic_status": "computed", "llm_relevance_label": "fix_target", "llm_judge_status": "completed_unverified", "llm_evidence": "Replaces SERVER_NAME colon partitioning with URL parsing to correctly extract IPv6 host and port."}, {"positive_id": "src/flask/testing.py/FlaskClient/session_transaction", "semantic_similarity": 0.318889, "semantic_status": "computed", "llm_relevance_label": "fix_target", "llm_judge_status": "completed_unverified", "llm_evidence": "Replaces request host colon partitioning with URL parsing for IPv6 session cookie handling."}], "groundtruth_status": "unverified_multi_target_candidates"}
